$I=\mu r^2$ ( where $\mu=$ reduced mass) $\mu=\frac{m_1 m_2}{m_1+m_2}=\frac{48}{7} \mathrm{amu}$ $=11.43 \times 10^{-27} \mathrm{~kg}$
Substituting in $I=\mu r^2$ we get,
$$
\begin{aligned}
r & =\sqrt{\frac{I}{\mu}}=\sqrt{\frac{1.87 \times 10^{-46}}{11.43 \times 10^{-27}}} \\
& =1.28 \times 10^{-10} \mathrm{~m}
\end{aligned}
$$
$\therefore$ The correct answer is (c).
